Ask the user a question with selectable answer options. Use this when you need the user to pick between choices (which environment, which approach, proceed or not). Renders as buttons or a select menu on platforms that support them, and as a numbered list on text-only channels. A selected option arrives as a future message — do not speculate about the answer; end your turn after asking. A typed reply is a normal future user message; it does not resolve or correlate this question automatically.
